+            <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
+          </button>
+        </h2>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-3">
+          <p>Kneading is a comforting behavior that starts in kittenhood. Adult cats may knead when they feel relaxed, safe, or especially fond of the person or spot beneath their paws.</p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <h2 class="question">
+          <button type="button" class="toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-4" id="question-4">
